  "description": "Make a variety of dinners, soups, side dishes, and desserts with the family-sized BLACK+DECKER® MULTICOOKER 7QT. With Neat 'N Clean™ technology, cleanup is quick and easy thanks to the dishwasher-safe pot and lid with non-stick ceramic coating. Simply remove the control panel and place the pot and lid in the dishwasher or submerge in water if washed by hand. Designed for all-in-one cooking, this versatile multicooker is designed with 5-in-1 functionality: slow cook, steam/boil, precision roasting, Sear/Saute, and rice, allowing you to create almost any type of meal in one appliance. Shade meats and vegetables at high temperatures with the Sear function, then choose the slow cook function to finish cooking. And the 8x longer lasting PFAS-free ceramic coating helps withstand dishwasher use for long-lasting performance, while cool-touch handles make serving and carrying easy. Includes cooking/roasting rack designed for perfectly cooked and delicious results.",
